I want it to look like a product.

Instead of

Password

***********

👁
we'll build something like this:

+------------------------------+
| React@123               👁    |
+------------------------------+
The eye icon stays inside the input field on the right.

This is how modern websites do it.

To achieve that, we'll learn two new CSS concepts:

position: relative

position: absolute

These are extremely important for frontend development and are used for icons, badges, dropdowns, notifications, and many other UI elements.

