📦 → FaBoxOpen

👤 → FaUserCircle

🚪 → FaSignOutAlt

This will make your dashboard look much more professional and consistent.

We'll also make each card clickable so:

Create Capsule → /create-capsule

My Capsules → /capsules

Profile → /profile

Logout → returns to the login page (and later clears the authentication token)

